OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Frather cloudy with rain in the
OL,7,Fevening, though perhaps some drier
OL,8,Fspells for Greater Glasgow at first.
OL,9,FRain becomes persistent and heavier
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloudy with heavy rain at
OL,13,Ffirst, this clearing in the morning.
OL,14,FThe mostly dry through the rest of the
OL,15,Fday with increasing bright spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
