OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,FThursday morning, then a band of cloud
OL,7,Fand rain passing southeast from
OL,8,FThursday afternoon. This soon clearing
OL,9,FFriday, then sunny spells and a few
OL,10,Fshowers. Rain or showers Saturday.
